cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "Sunflower-Formal: a machine-checked Coq account of the Erdős–Rado sunflower problem"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Falk"
    given-names: "Thomas"
    alias: "thomas-falk-research"
keywords:
  - Coq
  - formal verification
  - sunflower lemma
  - Erdős–Rado
  - Hall's marriage theorem
  - Kőnig's theorem
  - combinatorics
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Machine-checked Coq (8.18, stdlib-only) proofs of the Erdős–Rado
  sunflower upper bound, the matching exponential lower bound
  f(n,k) >= (k-1)^n + 1, the exact value f(2,3) = 7, and constructive
  Hall and Kőnig theorems; the open Sunflower Conjecture is stated
  formally, and the single axiom in the development is the published
  Alweiss–Lovett–Wu–Zhang 2020 bound, cited and used by nothing.
